---
import SectionHeader from "~/components/ui/SectionHeader.astro";
import { howIWork } from "~/data/site";
---
<section class="container-page section">
  <div class="grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-12">
    <div class="md:col-span-5">
      <SectionHeader
        eyebrow="How I work"
        title="I don't start with the programme. I start with the problem."
      />
    </div>

    <div class="md:col-span-6 md:col-start-7 reveal">
      <p class="text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] measure">
        Before designing a workshop, curriculum or learning journey, I want to understand:
      </p>

      <ol class="mt-8 space-y-0">
        {howIWork.map((q, i) => (
          <li class="flex gap-5 border-t border-[var(--color-rule)] py-5 last:border-b">
            <span class="eyebrow pt-1 shrink-0">{String(i + 1).padStart(2, "0")}</span>
            <span class="text-[1.05rem] text-[var(--color-ink)]">{q}</span>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ol>

      <div class="mt-10 space-y-5 text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] measure">
        <p>
          From there, I bring together strategy, learning design, organisational
          thinking and stakeholder insight to create an intervention that is fit
          for purpose.
        </p>
        <p>
          Because sometimes the answer is a leadership programme. Sometimes it's an
          executive learning journey. Sometimes it's coaching. And sometimes it's
          realising that a training programme
          <em class="not-italic font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]">isn't the answer at all</em>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
